# The digests of the two initrds mvmd's `make guest-initrd converter-initrd` builds at the mvmd
# commit the Go modules pin (`naru-release commit`): the Guest Agent's, and the converter's, which carries
# mkfs.erofs. mvmd builds each one twice and fails unless the two are byte-identical, so a build
# that gives another digest here is a different toolchain or a different commit, and
# the guest-initrds package's Dockerfile fails on it.
#
# Moved by: the PM, in the pull request that moves the mvmd pin of the Go modules; the digests are the ones the
# build prints.
GUEST_INITRD_SHA256=8bb0e2ff50f1e829c893a97905746198218a825044bd38a8200a647dddb44131
CONVERTER_INITRD_SHA256=8cf404326c4e00a533d810cd31800f470f114436c89c54ac837bb8c7762a8b7b
